s://arxiv.org/html/2312.10035?_immersive_translate_auto_translate=3D1#bib.b=
ib43" title=3D"" class=3D"ltx_ref">43</a>]</cite>. Voxel-based approaches t=
ransform point clouds into regular voxel grids to facilitate 3D convolution=
 operations&nbsp;<cite class=3D"ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href=3D"ht=
tps://arxiv.org/html/2312.10035?_immersive_translate_auto_translate=3D1#bib=
.bib53" title=3D"" class=3D"ltx_ref">53</a>, <a href=3D"https://arxiv.org/h=
tml/2312.10035?_immersive_translate_auto_translate=3D1#bib.bib70" title=3D"=
" class=3D"ltx_ref">70</a>]</cite>, with their efficiency subsequently enha=
nced by sparse convolution&nbsp;<cite class=3D"ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"=
>[<a href=3D"https://arxiv.org/html/2312.10035?_immersive_translate_auto_tr=
anslate=3D1#bib.bib84" title=3D"" class=3D"ltx_ref">84</a>, <a href=3D"http=
s://arxiv.org/html/2312.10035?_immersive_translate_auto_translate=3D1#bib.b=
