ss=3D"ltx_ref">52</a>]</cite> and have recently seen a shift towards transf=
ormer-based architectures&nbsp;<cite class=3D"ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">=
[<a href=3D"https://arxiv.org/html/2312.10035?_immersive_translate_auto_tra=
nslate=3D1#bib.bib27" title=3D"" class=3D"ltx_ref">27</a>, <a href=3D"https=
