datasets&nbsp;<cite class=3D"ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href=3D"https=
://arxiv.org/html/2312.10035?_immersive_translate_auto_translate=3D1#bib.bi=
b94" title=3D"" class=3D"ltx_ref">94</a>]</cite>. While major efforts in 3D=
