2.10035?_immersive_translate_auto_translate=3D1#bib.bib13" title=3D"" class=
=3D"ltx_ref">13</a>]</cite> has shown significant performance improvements,=
 increasing mIoU on ScanNet semantic segmentation from 72.2% to 77.0%&nbsp;=
<cite class=3D"ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href=3D"https://arxiv.org/h=
tml/2312.10035?_immersive_translate_auto_translate=3D1#bib.bib107" title=3D=
"" class=3D"ltx_ref">107</a>]</cite>. This outperforms PTv2 when trained fr=
om scratch by 1.6%, all while retaining superior efficiency.
