<p id=3D"S4.SS2.p5.1" class=3D"ltx_p" data-imt-p=3D"1">Furthermore, we illu=
strate patch grouping patterns derived from the four serialization patterns=
 on the right part of triplets in Fig.&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://arxiv.org/ht=
ml/2312.10035?_immersive_translate_auto_translate=3D1#S3.F3" title=3D"Figur=
