ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>. This grouping strategy, in tandem with our seria=
lization patterns, is designed to effectively broaden the attention mechani=
sm=E2=80=99s receptive field in the 3D space as the patch size increases wh=
ile still preserving spatial neighbor relationships to a feasible degree. A=
lthough this approach may sacrifice some neighbor search accuracy when comp=
ared to KNN, the trade-off is beneficial. Given the attention=E2=80=99s re-=
weighting capacity to reference points, the gains in efficiency and scalabi=
