a>, we also assess the effectiveness of each alternative patch interaction =
design. The default setting enables Shift Order, but the first row represen=
ts the baseline scenario using a single serialization pattern, indicative o=
f the vanilla configurations of Shift Patch and Shift Dilation (one single =
serialization order is not shiftable). The results indicate that while Shif=
