<p id=3D"A3.SS2.p1.1" class=3D"ltx_p" data-imt-p=3D"1">We extend our compre=
hensive evaluation of pre-training technologies and backbones to outdoor se=
mantic segmentation tasks, focusing on the SemanticKITTI&nbsp;<cite class=
