dix C Additional Comparision =E2=80=A3 Point Transformer V3: Simpler, Faste=
r, Stronger" class=3D"ltx_ref"><span class=3D"ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">22</spa=
n></a>) datasets. SemanticKITTI is derived from the KITTI Vision Benchmark =
Suite and consists of 22 sequences, with 19 for training and the remaining =
3 for testing. It features richly annotated LiDAR scans, offering a diverse=
 array of driving scenarios. Each point in this dataset is labeled with one=
 of 28 semantic classes, encompassing various elements of urban driving env=
ironments. NuScenes, on the other hand, provides a large-scale dataset for =
autonomous driving, comprising 1,000 diverse urban driving scenes from Bost=
on and Singapore. For outdoor semantic segmentation, we also employ the mea=
n class-wise intersection over union (mIoU) as the primary evaluation metri=
